title: "jvc-fault-size-shift: code and aggregated results for a study of fault-size shift in rolling-bearing diagnosis"
abstract: "Code, aggregated result files and manuscript sources for a controlled, negative-result study of cross-severity fault-size shift in rolling-bearing diagnosis on CWRU, with external checks on the Paderborn and JNU datasets."
